    Zod v4's .partial() still applies defaults on missing keys, so baseFields.msb.default('no')
    was being injected into updateRecordSchema.parse({ notes: 'x' }), causing partial PUTs to
    reset msb:'yes' to 'no'. Fix: Remove default from baseFields, apply it only in
    createRecordSchema per Phase 16 HIGH issue.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

