commit 6d567ac5fd7fb1b865f0a03bf88c09911060eeb0
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 3 09:00:31 2026 +0900

    fix(16-fix-3): add concurrent delete protection to update() method
    
    Check res.meta.changes after UPDATE statement. If a concurrent delete happened
    between findById() and UPDATE, the row no longer exists and we should return null
    instead of returning the merged record that was never written.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

